OL,3,AAngela Rayner says record Reform
OL,4,Adonations from crypto investors are a
OL,5,A'concern'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHousing Secretary Angela Rayner is
OL,8,Ffacing questions from Laura Kuenssberg
OL,9,Fafter Reform UK received two
OL,10,Frecord-breaking donations of #36m
OL,12,FAsked if Labour would have taken this
OL,13,Fmoney, Rayner says the Labour Party has
OL,14,F"strict rules" around donations, but
OL,15,Fadds that she doesn't know the
OL,16,Findividual circumstances of Reform's
OL,17,Fdonors
OL,19,FReform UK's economic spokesman Robert
OL,20,FJenrick is also set to be quizzed by
OL,21,FKuenssberg as the party faces scrutiny
OL,22,Fover its finances
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
